    "description": {
      "value": "<h2>Rig Hand</h2><p><em>You know what keeps a moving fortress from becoming a coffin.</em></p><hr /><h3>Rules</h3><p>You gain a rank in Tinkering (tinker’s tools). If you already have it, its rank rises by one instead.</p><p>During a Scene Break, you can perform emergency maintenance on a vehicle, rig, or facility. Choose one:</p><ul><li>Restore 1d6 Integrity to a construct/vehicle/rig under the GM’s control rules, or</li><li>Remove one non-magical malfunction or minor condition (stuck mechanism, seized hatch, jammed lock, fouled intake) at the GM’s discretion.</li></ul><p>Once you use this principle, you can’t use it again until you finish a Soma Break.</p><p class=\"ft-engine-note\"><em>⚙ +1 Tinkering. 🃏 Card — once per Soma Break.</em></p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
